Scripts for provisioning an x86 VM for use as a RESim target, e.g., for testing
Assumes  "mike ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:ALL" was added to /etc/sudoers

When done, convert to an image file: 
     VBoxManage clonemedium --format RAW /path/to/source.vdi /path/to/destination.img

TBD: we added build essential and xinetd packages.  Need instructions for those.
